<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 2.4 percent in the week ended April 25, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages fell 3.2 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 3.7 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index slipped 3.2 percent to 296.1 from a revised 310.6 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index rose 2.2 percent to 236.5 in the latest survey from a revised 231.3 in the previous week.  </p>
